invalid type: string "3. Vulnerability Scanning\n\nAuthorized vulnerability scans must be performed regularly.\n\nScanning requirements:\n\n- Critical systems: Weekly.\n- Standard systems: Monthly.\n- External assets: Monthly.\n\n\n4. Vulnerability Classification\n\nVulnerabilities must be prioritized using risk-based criteria.\n\nCritical:\nRemediation required within 14 days.\n\nHigh:\nA-002\n\n